  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROSUL REERGUE SUL- Program to Support Economic Recovery and Maintain Employment, and for Climate Prevention and Adaptation in the State of Rio Grande do Sul</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">PROSUL REERGUE SUL- Programa de Apoyo a la Recuperaci&#xf3;n Econ&#xf3;mica y el Mantenimiento del Empleo, y de Prevenci&#xf3;n y Adaptaci&#xf3;n al Clima en el Estado de Rio Grande do Sul</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa es promover la recuperaci&#xf3;n econ&#xf3;mica y la resiliencia clim&#xe1;tica en el estado de R&#xed;o Grande do Sul (RS). Los objetivos espec&#xed;ficos de desarrollo son: (i) ampliar la financiaci&#xf3;n a largo plazo de infraestructuras cr&#xed;ticas en los municipios de RS; y (ii) ampliar el acceso al cr&#xe9;dito para Micro, Peque&#xf1;as y Medianas Empresas (MIPYME) en &#xe1;reas afectadas por desastres naturales en el estado de RS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of the program is to promote economic recovery and climate resilience in the state of Rio Grande do Sul (RS). The specific development objectives are: (i) to expand long-term financing for critical infrastructure in the municipalities of RS; and (ii) to expand access to credit for Micro, Small, and Medium Enterprises (MSMEs) in areas affected by natural disasters in the state of RS.</narrative>
  </description>
